      "structure_description": "Four Ce(III) ions linked by four chloranilate anions and capped by terminal tpen ligands form a cationic molecular square. Perchlorate-mediated electrostatic interactions and C–H···O hydrogen bonds connect the squares into a three-dimensional framework. The reported architecture contains hexahedral, cuboctahedral, and rhombicuboctahedral cavities."
